WEBVTT

00:15:57.418 --> 00:16:00.593
i pronalazi nove načine
da iskaže sebe.

00:16:00.593 --> 00:16:04.804
Kada se osvrnemo oko sebe i vidimo

00:16:04.804 --> 00:16:07.368
da Majkl Blumberg uči da kodira,

00:16:07.368 --> 00:16:10.018
sva deca u Estoniji uče da kodiraju,

00:16:10.018 --> 00:16:12.218
čak je i moja majka naučila da programira,

00:16:12.218 --> 00:16:13.990
ne mislite li da je kranje vreme da
porazmislite o tome

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:15.902
da i vi naučite da programirate?

00:16:15.902 --> 00:16:18.095
Ako ste zainteresovani da pokušate

00:16:18.095 --> 00:16:20.531
želim da vam preporučim veb stranicu Skreča.

00:16:20.531 --> 00:16:22.556
Adresa je: scratch.mit.edu

00:16:22.556 --> 00:16:24.378
i probajte da programirate.

00:16:24.378 --> 00:16:28.496
Hvala vam puno.
(Aplauz)